WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.435
ALEXANDRA PELOSI:
So, how did you
get into the Capitol?

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.469
JANUARY SIXER: (OVER PHONE)
 I just walked right in.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.405
PELOSI: January 6th
really activated you.

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:06.373
Yeah.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.642
PELOSI:
 What was it inside of you
 that made you think,

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:11.878
 "I'm gonna go
 inside the Capitol"?

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:13.613
(COMMOTION)

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.582
PELOSI: I've been on the road
 meeting some of the Jan Sixers

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:18.884
 who were sent to jail
 for what they did that day.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:21.754
Did you go to the Capitol
to assassinate my mother?

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.089
No!

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:27.760
PELOSI:
You're rocking your MAGA tattoo
and your Trump socks.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:28.794
There we go.

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:31.130
PELOSI: I can see you're taking
the sentencing very seriously.

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:34.667
 You're the first January Sixer
 to walk in

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.168
 and take a felony charge.

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:38.638
It was a peaceful protest
that was hijacked.

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:41.674
PELOSI: Johnny, what if
you're wrong about everything?

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:42.976
I've been wrong before.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.146
PELOSI: Do you feel like
 you were a little brainwashed
 by President Trump?

00:00:46.645 --> 00:00:47.847
(PHONE BUZZES)

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:51.217
JANUARY SIXER 2:
 I feel so remorseful
 for what I did that day.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:55.188
PELOSI: The left says
that you're domestic terrorists.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.724
 The right says
 you're all just tourists.

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:00.460
But the United States government

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.796
 thinks you're all
 insurrectionists.

